        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Text to Speech (Audio8 Voice Clone)\n\nClones a voice from a short recording and speaks new text with it, in 23\nlanguages including Finnish. The reference is cut to its first 10 seconds and\ntranscribed with Whisper large-v3; Audio8 needs the exact words of the clip.\nCheck the transcript and type it into **Audio8 Reference Voice** by hand if\nWhisper got a word wrong. Keep references short and clean, without music.\n\nFor text longer than a few sentences, replace **Audio8 Speech** with **Audio8\nLong Speech**; one call holds about 24 seconds.\n\nModel: Edge0's Audio8-TTS-Realistic-Air, 0.6B, 44.1 kHz, Apache-2.0, int8\nfile from NidAll/audio8-tts-realistic-0.6b-int8-convrot (1.5 GB). Nodes:\nNidAll/ComfyUI-Audio8 (Apache-2.0). Profile `audio8-tts`.\n"
      ]
    }
